## Result

The bounded Program Roadmap for the qualified local completion watcher is complete. Its three milestones and gates were delivered, qualified, released, and remain present in Tool Shed v0.36.4.

## Milestone evidence

- M1 / G1: CAMP-0036 and EVD-0008 freeze and prove the watcher protocol, state machine, failure model, local security boundary, and executable portability oracle.
- M2 / G2: CAMP-0037 and EVD-0007 deliver and prove the opt-in local CLI, atomic spool, singleton runner, terminal outbox, cancellation, lease recovery, and local-only behavior.
- M3 / G3: CAMP-0038 and EVD-0009 record native Linux and Windows qualification, release provenance, installation/update distribution, rollback behavior, installed-client synchronization, and bounded pilot evidence.

